                            asis (DTADJ=0.2)      adj4x (DTADJ=0.05)
  A1  ENERGY2 (GPUPOT)      6.54 -> 0.83  (7.9x)  13.28 -> 1.65  (8.1x)
  A2  ADJUST total          8.86 -> 3.28          14.75 -> 3.16
  SUM all phases           21.08 -> 15.43         23.34 -> 11.59
  phase-sum speedup vs np1  2.94 -> 4.07x          2.31 -> 4.66x

  (np1 unchanged: 62.8 / 54.0 s -- serial path untouched. Slice imbalance
