REMAINING np8 RESIDUE (asis): A2-A1 = 2.5 s (XVPRED + CORE + LAGR + ADJUST
  bookkeeping, replicated), OUTPUT 1.9 s (file I/O), P2+P4+P9 = 2.3 s
